        <skos:definition>Direct class reference (alternative to pipeline). Use for external library classes like tvboptim.Bold, custom monitors, or any callable class. The class is instantiated with constructor_args and called with call_args. Example: {name: Bold, module: tvboptim.observations.tvb_monitors.bold, constructor_args: [{name: period, value: 1000.0}]}</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo"/>
