        <skos:definition>SLICE: label-based selector (xarray ``.sel``), keyed by dimension (reuses ``Argument``; name = dim, value = coordinate label), taking the nearest coordinate for a numeric selection. Never positional — picks e.g. one operating point out of a swept branch by its parameter value.</skos:definition>
