        <rdfs:label>trim_margins (slot)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Trim surrounding whitespace from the saved figure (default true). Trimming re-crops to the drawn content, so the saved aspect can differ from width/height; set false to preserve the declared width×height proportions exactly, e.g. to match an original figure. Renders as bbox_inches=&apos;tight&apos; on a matplotlib backend.</skos:definition>
