    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/CouplingDependentAuxiliaryRecording">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/SimulationTask"/>
        <tvbo:requiresCapability rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/PerStageCouplingEvaluation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Recording (via `output` or `record: true`) a derived/auxiliary variable whose equation reads a coupling input, with the auxiliary aligned to the state it is recorded alongside. Under the default per-step (frozen) coupling the recorded auxiliary carries the step-start coupling — one integration step behind the recorded post-step state — so exact state/coupling alignment requires per-stage coupling evaluation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Coupling-dependent auxiliary recording</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


